    "handoffChecks": [
      "Full WCAG contrast audit of every text/surface pair in both themes",
      "Dynamic Type / large text on compact screens",
      "Screen-reader announcements for timer state changes",
      "Chart alternative for the weekly bars",
      "Native control parity when rebuilt (SF Symbols, UISwitch, UISegmentedControl)"
